# A swing at 85 % power with the snap on time: start on the strip, power
# after 850 ms, snap when the marker comes back to the snap line
# (850 + 0.85 * 750 ms), with screenshots of the meter, the flight and the result.
# Clicks after each swing start are 120 ms later than the meter times above: on the IIIx the
# meter's clock starts about then, once its first frames show.
0 pen-down 20 150
60 pen-up
720 snapshot "{out}/s{n}-meter-up.png"
970 pen-down 80 60
1030 pen-up
1270 snapshot "{out}/s{n}-meter-down.png"
1607 pen-down 80 60
1667 pen-up
2320 snapshot "{out}/s{n}-flight-1.png"
2920 snapshot "{out}/s{n}-flight-2.png"
3520 snapshot "{out}/s{n}-flight-3.png"
4120 snapshot "{out}/s{n}-flight-4.png"
4720 snapshot "{out}/s{n}-flight-5.png"
5420 snapshot "{out}/s{n}-flight-6.png"
6120 snapshot "{out}/s{n}-result-1.png"
6920 snapshot "{out}/s{n}-result-2.png"
